---
// copy/global.md [GLOBAL-COOKIE] · answers #26. GA4 only loads after "Accept analytics".
---
<div class="ck" id="cookie" role="region" aria-label="Cookie preferences" hidden>
  <p>We use a few cookies to see which pages help people, and reCAPTCHA to keep spam out. No ads, no selling your data. <a class="link" href="/privacy">Read our privacy policy</a></p>
  <div class="ck-btns">
    <button class="btn btn--lime" type="button" data-consent="granted">Accept analytics</button>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-consent="denied">Essential only</button>
  </div>
  <p class="ck-toast mono" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</div>
<style>
  .ck { position: fixed; z-index: 60; right: 16px; bottom: 16px; max-width: min(440px, calc(100vw - 32px)); font-size: .9rem; background: var(--gray-900); border: 1px solid var(--gray-700); padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1rem; color: var(--gray-300); font-size: .95rem; }
  .ck[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ck-btns { display: flex; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .ck-toast:empty { display: none; }
</style>
